        "text": {
          "content": "<p>Shouts are extraordinary sonic mind-affecting abilities, normally a 30-foot radius and half character level rounds. Daily shout uses equal the number of shout feats. Hero Points must be declared before success or failure is known; the general options appear in the character sheet, while feat-specific options are shown only when the feat explicitly grants one.</p>",
